    <TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-underline-color: #000000; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">If
    the PRC operating entities are unable to collect their receivables from their customers, our results of operations and cash flows
    could be adversely affected. See &ldquo;<I>Risk Factors</I> &mdash; <I>If the PRC operating entities are unable to collect their
    receivables from their customers, our results of operations and cash flows could be adversely affected.</I>&rdquo; on page 31 of
