    to [_</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">_<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">] Class A Ordinary Shares included
    in the Units, up to [__] Pre-Funded Warrants, and up to [__] Class A Ordinary Shares issuable upon exercise of the Warrants at a
