    Share<BR> Post-Offering<SUP>(1)</SUP></B></FONT></TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
