    <TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-underline-color: #000000; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">reviewing
    and approving, or recommending to the board of directors to approve the compensation of our CEO and other executive officers and
    directors;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
