Committee. Our board has affirmatively determined that each of the members of the Compensation Committee meets the definition of &ldquo;independent
director&rdquo; for purposes of serving on Compensation Committee under NASDAQ rules.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

