<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>1.
ORGANIZATION AND PRINCIPAL ACTIVITIES</B>&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT></P>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Zhongchao
Inc. (&ldquo;Zhongchao Cayman&rdquo;, or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) is a holding company incorporated on April 16, 2019, under the laws
of the Cayman Islands. The Company commenced operations on August 17, 2012, through its variable interest entity (&ldquo;VIE&rdquo;),
Zhongchao Medical Technology (Shanghai) Limited (&ldquo;Zhongchao Shanghai&rdquo;), a limited liability company established under the
laws of the PRC. The Company provides customized medical courses and customized medical training services to pharmaceutical enterprises,
and not-for-profit organizations (&ldquo;NFPs&rdquo;) including medical associations, medical institutions, medical journals, medical
foundations, hospitals and etc. and sales of pharmaceutical products in the PRC.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

