    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; text-indent: -9pt; padding-left: 9pt">Class B Ordinary Share (par value $0.008 per share, 250,000,000 shares authorized; 68,722 and 68,722 shares issued and outstanding on December 31, 2024 and 2023, respectively) *</TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD>
