<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><B>17. SEGMENT
REPORTING</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
Company&rsquo;s organizational structure is based on a number of factors that the CODM uses to evaluate, view and run its business operations
which include, but not limited to, customer base, homogeneity of service and technology. The Company&rsquo;s operating segments are based
on such organizational structure and information reviewed by the CODM to evaluate the operating segment results. Based on management&rsquo;s
assessment, the Company has determined that it had two operating segments before the disposal of the sales of patented drugs operating
segment on June 30, 2025: (i)&nbsp;MDMOOC services, and (ii)&nbsp;sales of patented drugs.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
disposal of the patented drug sales business signifies a strategic shift. However, the revenue and assets of the sales of patented drugs
operating segment are not material to the Company&rsquo;s total revenue and total assets. Therefore,&nbsp;the disposal of the sales of
patented drugs operating segment will not have a material impact on the Company&rsquo;s operations or financial performance and is not
considered as discontinued operation.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
following table presents major accounts of statements of operations by segments for the&nbsp;six months ended June 30, 2025.</FONT></P>

