of June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024, the weighted average remaining lease term was 0.67 and 1.42 years, respectively, and discount
rates were 4.75% for all of the operating leases.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Rental
expenses for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024 were $51,252 and $174,146, respectively. For the six months ended June 30, 2025
and 2024, the cash payment for amounts included in the measurement of lease liabilities was nil and $11,794, respectively.</FONT></P>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

